,"s":200.82,"e":201.14},{"w":"fair!","s":201.14,"e":201.7},{"w":"Athletes","s":202.1,"e":202.66},{"w":"sacrifice","s":202.66,"e":203.22},{"w":"everything","s":203.22,"e":203.7},{"w":"for","s":203.7,"e":203.86},{"w":"this,","s":203.86,"e":204.34},{"w":"and","s":204.34,"e":204.58},{"w":"the","s":204.58,"e":204.74},{"w":"headlines","s":204.74,"e":205.06},{"w":"went","s":205.06,"e":205.38},{"w":"to","s":205.38,"e":205.46},{"w":"a","s":205.46,"e":205.62},{"w":"man","s":205.62,"e":205.78},{"w":"who","s":205.78,"e":205.94},{"w":"finished","s":205.94,"e":206.34},{"w":"last.","s":206.34,"e":206.98},{"w":"Doesn't","s":207.3,"e":207.62},{"w":"that","s":207.62,"e":207.78},{"w":"cheapen","s":207.78,"e":208.18},{"w":"the","s":208.18,"e":208.34},{"w":"competition?","s":208.34,"e":209.013}]},{"speaker":"Zendaya","start":209.413,"end":216.844,"text":"Or does it capture the original Olympic spirit? The important thing is not winning but taking part — that is literally the founder's famous line.","words":[{"w":"Or","s":209.413,"e":209.54},{"w":"does","s":209.54,"e":209.7},{"w":"it","s":209.7,"e":209.86},{"w":"capture","s":209.86,"e":210.26},{"w":"the","s":210.26,"e":210.42},{"w":"original","s":210.42,"e":210.82},{"w":"Olympic","s":210.82,"e":211.38},{"w":"spirit?","s":211.38,"e":211.86},{"w":"The","s":211.86,"e":212.02},{"w":"important","s":212.02,"e":212.42},{"w":"thing","s":212.42,"e":212.66},{"w":"is","s":212.66,"e":212.82},{"w":"not","s":212.82,"e":213.06},{"w":"winning","s":213.06,"e":213.54},{"w":"but","s":213.54,"e":213.86},{"w":"taking","s":213.86,"e":214.26},{"w":"part","s":214.26,"e":214.58},{"w":"—","s":214.58,"e":214.635},{"w":"that","s":214.635,"e":215.035},{"w":"is","s":215.035,"e":215.195},{"w":"literally","s":215.195,"e":215.515},{"w":"the","s":215.515,"e":215.675},{"w":"founder's","s":215.675,"e":216.155},{"w":"famous","s":216.155,"e":216.475},{"w":"line.","s":216.475,"e":216.844}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":217.144,"end":227.546,"text":"Well, the Committee sided wit